":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"A visit by a first year student inspires Kyōko to draw a doujin about her and Yui, prompting Chinatsu to respond with her own story, presented in a fearsome art style. They then decide to make some clay art figures. Later, everyone meets Yui's relative's child, Mari, with Chinatsu reluctantly dressing up as her favorite anime character for her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yVmcyVcrNjhYkj1y6B3r6vvejV3.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8353","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10495","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10495","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"52891","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"250022","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"29565","synopsis":"With Christmas coming up, Kyōko holds a lottery to arrange the girls into pretend couples for mock dates. Kyōko and Chinatsu go to the movies and the arcade, Akari and Chitose visit some cafés, Himawari and Sakurako go to a restaurant while Ayano and Yui just sit around talking about their friends. Later, the girl's spend New Year's at home where they check their greetings cards from each other.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3nYjXce7tUZFiVDrkpVXiyCKXQI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"With Christmas coming up, Kyōko holds a lottery to arrange the girls into pretend couples for mock dates. Kyōko and Chinatsu go to the movies and the arcade, Akari and Chitose visit some cafés, Himawari and Sakurako go to a restaurant while Ayano and Yui just sit around talking about their friends. Later, the girl's spend New Year's at home where they check their greetings cards from each other.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3nYjXce7tUZFiVDrkpVXiyCKXQI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8353","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10495","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10495","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"52891","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"250022","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"29560","synopsis":"On April's Fools Day, Chitose decides to play a lying game with Ayano, who later discovers that all of her supposed lies were actually true. Later, Kyōko tries to get the attention of Chitose, only to discover it to be her twin sister, Chizuru, who doesn't particularly take too kindly to Kyōko.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/awevpC4qDNAPVrJqHmqE3atc66z.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"On April's Fools Day, Chitose decides to play a lying game with Ayano, who later discovers that all of her supposed lies were actually true. Later, Kyōko tries to get the attention of Chitose, only to discover it to be her twin sister, Chizuru, who doesn't particularly take too kindly to Kyōko.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/awevpC4qDNAPVrJqHmqE3atc66z.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8353","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10495","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10495","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"52891","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"250022","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"29567","synopsis":"The girls try to find way to distract themselves from the Summer heat. While visiting the student council r